#### *Note: Unit One only covers HTML and CSS. JavaScript will be introduced in Unit 2*. 



## Why it matters for students:

#### **Building web apps helps students:**
- #### See the connection between code and creativity.
- #### Practice problem-solving and computational thinking.
- #### Understand how many of the tools they use every day (from Google Docs to ChatGPT) are built with the same foundational technologies.


## Next Up

#### Let's take a look at the final project the students will create in this unit. 

